Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether $\bigcap_{P\in \mathrm{Spec}(R)} \mathrm{Id}(P)=\{0\}$ for every commutative unital ring $R$, where $\mathrm{Id}(P)$ is the ideal generated by idempotent elements of $P$.

**Answer Leak Check:** No leaked answers or solutions found in the problem statement.

